WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
Safex

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:12.071
Daisy, who suffers from hemophilia,
was feeling depressed all day.

00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:18.150
With Candy's help,
she's getting optimistic gradually.

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:25.991
Determined footsteps
that resound in one's heart

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:02.786
What are they doing?

00:01:05.932 --> 00:01:07.726
Please!

00:01:07.876 --> 00:01:10.361
- Be careful.
- Yes, I'll be fine.

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:20.910
Sister Pony, sister Lane!

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:24.080
Candy!

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:28.047
Where did Jimmy go
in the early morning?

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:30.513
To Mr. Cartwright's pastures.

00:01:30.663 --> 00:01:35.253
Jimmy works in the pasture,
don't you know that?

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:39.888
Jimmy works
for the children of Pony's Home.

00:01:40.038 --> 00:01:41.425
For the children?

00:01:41.575 --> 00:01:46.031
Yes. He gets milk
in exchange for his work.

00:01:46.181 --> 00:01:48.870
It was Jimmy's idea.

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:51.569
The milk we drink every morning...

00:01:51.719 --> 00:01:54.239
Yes, it's Jimmy's contribution.

00:01:54.389 --> 00:01:56.111
I didn't know that.

00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:59.444
Sister Pony, sister Lane,
can I go with him?

00:01:59.594 --> 00:02:02.547
Mr. Cartwright must be very happy.

00:02:02.697 --> 00:02:05.517
Look, sister Pony!

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:07.822
Jimmy!

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:09.627
Well.

00:02:10.864 --> 00:02:12.263
Okay!

00:02:24.377 --> 00:02:26.641
Jimmy.

00:02:29.616 --> 00:02:33.575
Boss. Candy boss!

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.480
Wait for me! Jimmy!

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:40.152
I'll go with you!

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:49.532
Candy boss became a snowman.

00:02:51.838 --> 00:02:53.669
You are bad-mannered!

00:02:55.675 --> 00:02:57.802
You want to go too, Kurin?

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:08.813
I had no idea that...

00:03:08.963 --> 00:03:11.583
...you go to work
to exchange the milk every day

00:03:11.733 --> 00:03:14.024
while everybody is sleeping.

00:03:14.227 --> 00:03:17.388
Since you're not at home,
I am the boss here.

00:03:17.538 --> 00:03:20.557
I must take care of everybody.

00:03:22.235 --> 00:03:25.602
Jimmy has grown up.

00:03:35.748 --> 00:03:37.075
Pull over!

00:03:37.225 --> 00:03:38.510
Why?

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:41.110
I'd like to take a look.

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:45.683
I remember that

00:03:45.833 --> 00:03:50.058
we went to Mr. Cartwright's pasture
on Christmas Eve.

00:04:21.361 --> 00:04:25.571
After that,
you went to London in spring.

00:04:25.721 --> 00:04:27.290
Time passed swiftly.

00:04:33.239 --> 00:04:37.005
You got heavier in England.

00:04:37.577 --> 00:04:39.571
What do you mean, Jimmy?

00:04:39.721 --> 00:04:43.274
Nothing!
I didn't say that you're fat.

00:04:43.424 --> 00:04:44.475
You...

00:04:44.625 --> 00:04:45.977
Need some help, boss?

00:04:46.127 --> 00:04:49.715
Don't be silly, I don't need help.

00:04:51.224 --> 00:04:53.351
Help! Jimmy!

00:04:58.264 --> 00:05:00.425
You are doing well.

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:05.124
Of course, I practiced seriously
while you were away.

00:05:05.274 --> 00:05:08.002
What have you learnt in London?

00:05:24.123 --> 00:05:28.287
Don't let the tree catch a cold,
Mr. Cartwright.

00:05:29.629 --> 00:05:31.961
Candy!

00:05:32.465 --> 00:05:34.524
Long time no see, Mr. Cartwright.

00:05:37.203 --> 00:05:41.003
I missed you so much, Candy.

00:05:41.507 --> 00:05:43.805
What's the matter, Mr. Cartwright?

00:05:45.578 --> 00:05:49.340
I need to be looked after
more than the tree.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:51.542
Mr. Cartwright, I am sorry.

00:05:52.318 --> 00:05:54.178
I left for London
without telling you.

00:05:54.328 --> 00:05:58.656
No, you are home now!

00:06:01.961 --> 00:06:03.421
Mr. Cartwright...

00:06:03.571 --> 00:06:08.000
The elders are apt to shed tears.

00:06:09.001 --> 00:06:12.334
I have something to tell you.

00:06:18.444 --> 00:06:21.072
Mr. Cartwright,
what do you want to say?

00:06:21.222 --> 00:06:23.479
Take a look.

00:06:28.121 --> 00:06:30.783
Hold! Just a moment!

00:06:32.258 --> 00:06:33.657
Watch this!

00:06:35.528 --> 00:06:37.018
It's cool, Jimmy!

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.493
It's perfect!

00:06:56.749 --> 00:06:58.774
Something about Jimmy?

00:06:59.352 --> 00:07:02.549
Jimmy's wearing my used gun belt.

00:07:02.955 --> 00:07:05.253
I gave it to him on purpose.

00:07:06.592 --> 00:07:10.254
I hope that
he would inherit this pasture someday.

00:07:10.404 --> 00:07:11.956
Does Jimmy know this?

00:07:12.465 --> 00:07:14.559
- No!
- Why?

00:07:14.709 --> 00:07:19.430
I'm afraid to be refused,
just like you did before.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:21.268
Mr. Cartwright.

00:07:22.575 --> 00:07:26.471
Mr. Cartwright,
I'm sure that Jimmy will take it.

00:07:26.621 --> 00:07:28.810
I hope so!

00:07:30.249 --> 00:07:32.643
Jimmy's going to be
Mr. Cartwright's inheritor!

00:07:32.793 --> 00:07:34.686
Such good news!

00:07:35.154 --> 00:07:36.951
That's great, Jimmy!

00:07:37.723 --> 00:07:42.183
Candy, will you tell Jimmy for me?

00:07:42.728 --> 00:07:44.522
It's my pleasure.

00:07:44.672 --> 00:07:46.189
Thanks!

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:59.004
Here's a present for Candy's return.

00:07:59.278 --> 00:08:01.542
Thank you, Mr. Cartwright!

00:08:02.148 --> 00:08:05.276
Give my regards
to sister Pony and sister Lane.

00:08:05.818 --> 00:08:07.683
- Okay!
- Good bye!

00:08:09.922 --> 00:08:12.413
- Be careful!
- Yes!

00:08:19.765 --> 00:08:22.325
- Jimmy...
- What's the matter, boss?

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:25.729
What do you think of Mr. Cartwright?

00:08:25.879 --> 00:08:27.737
He is a good man.

00:08:28.508 --> 00:08:31.969
Have you ever thought that
you might become his inheritor?

00:08:32.119 --> 00:08:34.672
- I've never thought of that.
- Is that so?

00:08:34.822 --> 00:08:37.275
But I would not accept that.

00:08:37.425 --> 00:08:39.580
Why, Jimmy?

00:08:39.952 --> 00:08:44.548
Candy boss has come back now,
I will stay with you.

00:08:45.725 --> 00:08:47.090
Jimmy!

00:08:55.101 --> 00:08:58.366
Everybody, milk's coming!

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:10.344
Welcome back, Jimmy, Candy!

00:09:16.522 --> 00:09:20.549
Boss, they look so happy,
that's enough.

00:09:20.893 --> 00:09:23.588
Jimmy has grown up for sure!

00:09:23.738 --> 00:09:27.119
He'll be happy
if he can stay with Mr. Cartwright.

00:09:27.269 --> 00:09:30.258
Sister Pony and sister Lane
will agree with that for sure.

00:09:32.538 --> 00:09:35.803
Has Mr. Cartwright asked for that?

00:09:35.975 --> 00:09:38.835
How nice, sister Pony!

00:09:38.985 --> 00:09:40.471
But Jimmy...

00:09:40.621 --> 00:09:43.982
Don't worry, we'll deal with him.

00:09:48.888 --> 00:09:51.682
No! I'm not going anywhere!

00:09:51.832 --> 00:09:52.951
Jimmy!

00:09:53.559 --> 00:09:58.223
I want to stay with Candy boss
and take care of everybody.

00:09:59.165 --> 00:10:00.427
Jimmy!

00:10:07.073 --> 00:10:11.772
Damn it!

00:10:15.047 --> 00:10:16.309
Jimmy!

00:10:17.016 --> 00:10:20.344
Does the boss not need me anymore?

00:10:20.494 --> 00:10:22.751
It's not true!

00:10:24.056 --> 00:10:25.751
Boss!

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:49.874
We should not force him.

00:10:50.024 --> 00:10:53.612
Let's leave this topic for a while.

00:10:57.723 --> 00:10:58.883
Jimmy!

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:03.988
Jimmy, Mr. Cartwright is...

00:11:06.666 --> 00:11:09.794
Isn't that a pistol?
It's cowboy's hand-carry.

00:11:10.036 --> 00:11:12.368
I hate that!

00:11:13.839 --> 00:11:15.306
Jimmy!

00:11:37.263 --> 00:11:39.490
Jimmy wants to stay with me.

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:42.125
As long as I am not here,
he will go to the pasture.

00:11:42.835 --> 00:11:45.129
But where am I going?

00:11:45.279 --> 00:11:47.638
There's no direction.

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:53.678
Jimmy should have his own happiness.

00:11:54.413 --> 00:11:56.073
Tom! That's it!

00:11:56.223 --> 00:11:59.290
He was adopted by Mr. Steve
in the same way.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:01.812
As an elder, Tom will persuade him.

00:12:01.962 --> 00:12:03.855
Jimmy will accept that for sure.

00:12:13.833 --> 00:12:15.391
Good morning, Jimmy.

00:12:16.302 --> 00:12:17.633
Good morning.

00:12:19.772 --> 00:12:21.766
Look, Jimmy!

00:12:21.916 --> 00:12:23.502
It's...

00:12:25.344 --> 00:12:27.642
I did it for you last night.

00:12:28.214 --> 00:12:29.607
Boss?

00:12:29.757 --> 00:12:31.843
Put it on.

00:12:36.856 --> 00:12:38.881
That's great!

00:12:39.225 --> 00:12:41.921
You look so cool, Mr. Cowboy!

00:12:42.561 --> 00:12:44.927
Don't try to bribe me with this.

00:12:45.831 --> 00:12:47.025
Jimmy!

00:12:47.666 --> 00:12:51.261
I won't be fooled, I don't want it.

00:12:51.604 --> 00:12:54.402
I have no intention of bribing you.

00:12:55.007 --> 00:12:56.440
Really?

00:12:56.809 --> 00:12:59.744
Candy is not a stingy guy.

00:12:59.912 --> 00:13:03.939
Boss, I am willing to accept.
Thank you!

00:13:04.717 --> 00:13:08.414
- Let's go to the pasture.
- Okay!

00:13:27.973 --> 00:13:29.800
It is nice, Jimmy.

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:32.036
Your posture is sheer.

00:13:33.212 --> 00:13:35.573
The Candy boss did it for me

00:13:35.723 --> 00:13:39.043
You look like a cowboy taking charge
of the whole locality!

00:13:39.193 --> 00:13:40.915
Quite right!

00:13:48.327 --> 00:13:50.761
Why are you bullying raccoons?

00:13:55.401 --> 00:13:56.925
Where is Mr. Cartwright?

00:13:57.536 --> 00:13:59.436
He has got a cold and had a rest.

00:14:04.777 --> 00:14:06.438
Candy!

00:14:08.814 --> 00:14:11.078
No way, lie down!

00:14:16.689 --> 00:14:19.316
Don't you want to see a doctor?

00:14:19.466 --> 00:14:21.859
You are even more effective
than the doctor.

00:14:22.094 --> 00:14:24.392
How is Jimmy?

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:29.057
Don't move! You have a cold
and you must cure first.

00:14:30.169 --> 00:14:32.229
You have a fever, as expected.

00:14:32.379 --> 00:14:36.064
You're good at looking after patients.

00:14:36.214 --> 00:14:39.170
No! I still have
a lot of things to learn.

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:43.181
I'll deal with Jimmy.
Why don't you take some sleep?

00:14:48.254 --> 00:14:53.248
I'm so useless, compared with her.

00:14:55.861 --> 00:14:59.126
It's like this, take a look.

00:15:05.304 --> 00:15:08.566
Candy did that for him last night.

00:15:08.716 --> 00:15:14.672
Candy's working so hard just like us.

00:15:14.822 --> 00:15:16.407
I hope so!

00:15:16.557 --> 00:15:20.646
The happiness of others
is more important than hers.

00:15:26.659 --> 00:15:28.018
Jimmy!

00:15:28.168 --> 00:15:29.788
Boss!

00:15:31.063 --> 00:15:32.388
Where are you going?

00:15:32.538 --> 00:15:35.092
Tom's pasture, please!

00:15:35.242 --> 00:15:37.226
Okay!

00:15:47.012 --> 00:15:48.505
It's been a long time...

00:15:48.655 --> 00:15:50.810
since I last visited Tom's pasture.

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:54.219
You were here before going to London.

00:15:55.654 --> 00:15:59.750
Are you going to leave again?

00:15:59.992 --> 00:16:02.085
Of course not.

00:16:20.312 --> 00:16:22.974
Excuse me, is Tom at home?

00:16:24.049 --> 00:16:25.509
Tom!

00:16:25.659 --> 00:16:28.382
Candy! What a surprise!

00:16:29.688 --> 00:16:30.814
Tom!

00:16:35.427 --> 00:16:38.885
Jimmy,
it's a good thing to Inherit a pasture.

00:16:41.433 --> 00:16:44.664
I am happy for everything I have here.

00:16:45.137 --> 00:16:49.005
The pasture is going to be changed.
It's a great moment.

00:16:50.876 --> 00:16:53.618
The era of the pistol will be over.

00:16:53.768 --> 00:16:55.706
The era of riding horse
will be changed too.

00:16:55.856 --> 00:16:58.750
The pasture needs to be modernized.

00:16:59.685 --> 00:17:01.346
You should know that...

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:04.348
...a man should take the challenging work.

00:17:05.958 --> 00:17:08.222
Tom looks so excited.

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:12.191
He already found his own way
with full confidence.

00:17:18.103 --> 00:17:21.971
I am so ashamed, Tom works so hard.

00:17:22.141 --> 00:17:28.238
I went to England for studying,
and still can't find my own direction.

00:17:28.388 --> 00:17:31.305
Boss, you look so listless.

00:17:32.084 --> 00:17:33.210
Jimmy!

00:17:34.553 --> 00:17:35.781
Boss!

00:17:35.954 --> 00:17:41.221
Jimmy, don't take me as the model,
you should learn from Tom.

00:17:54.106 --> 00:17:56.467
- Candy!
- I'm back.

00:17:56.617 --> 00:18:00.376
Candy,
go take care of Mr. Cartwright at once.

00:18:01.113 --> 00:18:03.273
What happened, sister Pony?

00:18:03.423 --> 00:18:08.115
Mr. Cartwright has a high fever,
sister Lane is there already.

00:18:08.954 --> 00:18:10.353
Jimmy!

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:16.721
Please, Candy!

00:18:44.823 --> 00:18:46.016
Doctor!

00:18:46.166 --> 00:18:48.787
It’s okay! It's just a cold.

00:18:49.928 --> 00:18:54.160
It's nothing serious!
Don't let him worry too much.

00:18:55.834 --> 00:18:59.235
It is Candy
who advised him to take a rest.

00:18:59.938 --> 00:19:04.301
It is also you
who advised him to send for a doctor.

00:19:04.451 --> 00:19:06.435
I'll leave everything to you, Candy.

00:19:06.645 --> 00:19:07.873
Yes!

00:19:16.054 --> 00:19:17.681
Thank you, Jimmy!

00:19:35.007 --> 00:19:36.907
Jimmy!

00:19:51.156 --> 00:19:53.917
- Mr. Cartwright!
- Jimmy!

00:19:54.067 --> 00:19:55.960
Thank you!

00:19:59.431 --> 00:20:01.194
Mr. Cartwright...

00:20:05.871 --> 00:20:07.361
Mr. Cartwright!

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:10.369
Candy!

00:20:10.676 --> 00:20:12.769
You need rest!

00:20:12.919 --> 00:20:15.105
I was just away...

00:20:15.255 --> 00:20:17.045
I am sorry!

00:20:17.349 --> 00:20:20.941
You should lie in bed having a rest,
be good!

00:20:21.091 --> 00:20:22.645
Soup!

00:20:29.428 --> 00:20:31.828
Boss! Candy boss!

00:20:33.131 --> 00:20:35.292
Don't worry!

00:20:35.601 --> 00:20:40.397
I will stay with Mr. Cartwright
and look after him forever.

00:20:40.547 --> 00:20:41.666
Jimmy!

00:21:02.761 --> 00:21:06.253
Mr. Albert, Terry, Tom,

00:21:06.632 --> 00:21:08.356
and Jimmy.

00:21:08.506 --> 00:21:11.129
You had found your own way already.

00:21:12.504 --> 00:21:16.934
Those determined footsteps...

00:21:17.084 --> 00:21:20.410
...resounded into Candy's heart.
